jobs.description:
Are you looking for a fulltime job in logistics? Would you like to work in a modern, international warehouse where fashion and clothing products are shipped to customers all over the world? Then this opportunity could be perfect for you!

For a large logistics clothing warehouse in Lelystad, we are looking for motivated Production Workers, Warehouse Operatives, and Logistics Associates. You will become part of a friendly international team where teamwork, quality, and a positive working atmosphere are key. On top of that, you can enjoy a delicious hot lunch every working day.

As a Production Worker in the warehouse, you will help ensure that all goods are processed efficiently and accurately. Your tasks will include:

- Loading and unloading trucks;
- Picking and packing customer orders;
- Checking products for quality;
- Unpacking boxes and processing incoming goods;
- Sorting clothing and accessories;
- Maintaining a clean and safe working environment.

This is a full-time position in a 2-shift rotation:

- Morning shift: 07:00 AM - 03:30 PM
- Afternoon shift: 03:00 PM - 11:30 PM

But there is also a nightshift you can work if you want from 23:00 tot 07:30. And there is work in the weekends!

- (Basic) English communication skills, or Polish or Spanish;
- Availability for full-time work in a 2-shift schedule;
- Ability to work effectively in a team;
- Physically fit and comfortable performing active warehouse work;
- Attention to detail and ability to follow instructions;
- Previous logistics or warehouse experience is a plus, but not required.

Wat je gaat doen As a production worker in the cheese factory, you work in the shaving department. Here, large cheese blocks are prepared for the next stage of production.

Your tasks include:- placing 15 kg cheese blocks at your workstation;
- using a machine to remove the outer layer of the cheese;
- checking that the cheese is processed correctly;
- moving processed cheese with an electric pallet truck;
- keeping your workstation clean, safe and organised;
- working with your team to achieve the daily production targets.

Do you not yet have experience with an EPT? That is not a problem. You can learn this on the job and may have the opportunity to obtain your EPT certificate.   Wat we je bieden Your work as a production worker is rewarded with:- a base salary of €17.31 gross per hour;
- a 30% allowance between 18:00 and 22:00;
- a 40% allowance between 22:00 and 07:00;
- a performance bonus of up to €2.00 gross per hour;
- a full-time job in a stable 3-shift schedule;
- free weekends;
- 8% holiday pay;
- 20 vacation days and 4 additional days in a flex budget;
- travel allowance from 10 km;
- the prospect of a permanent contract;
- on-the-job training and the opportunity to obtain an EPT certificate;
- personal support from Start People at the production location.

At Start People, we operate on the principle of equal pay; your terms and conditions of employment always match those of colleagues who are employed directly by the client. This means that, in addition to your hourly rate, your terms and conditions of employment also include, for example, the number of days off, allowances, time-off-in-lieu payments and other pay components.   Functie-eisen This job is a good match if you:- can repeatedly lift cheese blocks weighing 15 kg;
